        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hat_Creek_(California)"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The lower three and a half miles of Hat Creek are a California Department of Fish and Game “Wild Trout Waterway” with strict catch limits.",
